NOTICE: GLOSS reference-sign motion files

The motion files in this folder (<sign>.json) are DERIVED DATA. Each one was
computed from a video in the ASL Citizen dataset: MediaPipe landmarks were
extracted from the reference signer's video and converted into humanoid joint
rotations and facial blendshape scores.

ASL Citizen's licence permits non-commercial research use only and forbids
redistributing the data, or modified versions of it, and hosting it for
others. These derived files are therefore provided for non-commercial
research use within the GLOSS / CareSense research project only and must not
be redistributed, published, or hosted for third parties.

The files are used for display only (an animated reference demonstration).
They play no part in recognising or grading a learner's sign; grading uses
the original landmark pipeline.

Source dataset: ASL Citizen (Desai et al., 2023). Video identifiers in each
file's "source" field are the renamed local file names (asl_citizen_NNN)
used in this project, not the original ASL Citizen file names.
